cs><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>″</mi></mrow></semantics></math>Tích các số ghi trên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> thẻ lấy ra chia hết cho <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>″</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Chia <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>50</mn></semantics></math> thẻ thành <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>3</mn></semantics></math> nhóm:\n\t\t\t<ul><li><strong>Nhóm 1</strong>: gồm  <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>25</mn></semantics></math> thẻ mang số lẻ.</li><li><strong>Nhóm 2</strong>: gồm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>12</mn></semantics></math> thẻ mang số chia hết cho <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math>.</li><li><strong>Nhóm 3</strong>: gồm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>13</mn></semantics></math> thẻ mang số chia hết cho <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math>.</li></ul>\n\t\t\t Do đó để tích các số ghi trên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> thẻ lấy ra chia hết cho <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math> ta lấy như sau:\n\t\t\t<ul><li>Lấy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> thẻ thuộc nhóm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>12</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>66</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (cách).</li><li>Lấy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math> thẻ thuộc nhóm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math> thẻ thuộc nhóm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>12</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>25</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (cách).</li><li>Lấy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math> thẻ thuộc nhóm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math> thẻ thuộc nhóm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>3</mn></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>12</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>13</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>156</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (cách).</li><li>Lấy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> thẻ thuộc nhóm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>3</mn></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=